      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "One side's clock in a duel; the active side has a gold border.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-clock\"><div class=\"ds-clock-name\">נועם</div><div class=\"ds-clock-num\">12.6</div><div class=\"ds-clock-role\">תוקף</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-clock{font-family:Heebo,system-ui,sans-serif;direction:rtl;background:#0A1D55;border:2px solid #F8C95C;border-radius:12px;padding:8px;text-align:center;color:#fff;width:150px}.ds-clock-name{font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.ds-clock-num{font-weight:900;font-size:34px;line-height:40px}.ds-clock-role{color:#B8CBEA;font-size:12px}"
